<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Heifers - Select and Choice 2-4 1200 lbs ld 68.00.</p>
<p>Carcass basis steers and heifers were not well tested. Heifers - Select and Choice 2-4 1100-1175 lbs few 109.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Tues - 100   Week to Date - 3,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
